{"id":"NCT07639255","title":"Kentucky - Quality Improvement Implementation Lung Cancer Screening (QUILS™) Implementation","official":"Statewide Optimization of Lung Cancer Screening Utilizing the QUILS System","summary":"This is an optimization pathway for lung cancer screening programs. Enrolled programs will undergo an audit for elements associated with improved quality and retention of patients in the screening process. A feedback report is delivered to identify priorities for process improvement.","conditions":["Lung Cancer Screening"],"interventions":[{"type":"OTHER","name":"QUILS System"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Participants in Lung Cancer Screening Program, including physicians, nurses, administrators and other staff responsible for the conduct of the program.\n* Willing to participate in the QUILS Index Assessment Survey process\n* Willing to participate in the QUILS Audit Feedback presentations Willing to participate in formative evaluation interviews\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Unwilling to participate in the QUILS Index Assessment Survey process\n* Unwilling to participate in the QUILS Audit Feedback presentations\n* Unwilling to participate in formative evaluation interviews","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"100 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"SCREENING","enrollment":330,"start":"2025-04-01","pcd":"2027-06-01","upd":"2026-07-01","sponsor":"Timothy Mullett","areas":["oncology"],"central":["Joseph Alexander, MD · 8593230892 · joseph.alexander@uky.edu"],"sites":[{"f":"King's Daughter's Medical Center","city":"Ashland","pr":"Kentucky","zip":"41101","s":"R","lat":38.4784,"lon":-82.6379,"c":"Joseph Alexander · 8593230892 · joseph.alexander@uky.edu"},{"f":"Taylor Regional Hospital","city":"Campbellsville","pr":"Kentucky","zip":"42718","s":"R","lat":37.3434,"lon":-85.3419,"c":"Joseph Alexander · 8593230892 · joseph.alexander@uky.edu"},{"f":"St. Elizabeth Healthcare","city":"Edgewood","pr":"Kentucky","zip":"41